WEBVTT

00:03.190 --> 00:06.690
That's why you've taken a liking to this place?

00:06.690 --> 00:10.690
There are still some types 
of alcohol I haven't tried here.

00:10.690 --> 00:14.220
On top of that, we were 
so busy discussing our deal

00:14.220 --> 00:17.780
that we didn't have time 
to talk about other things.

00:17.780 --> 00:19.490
Well, I'm grateful for it.

00:19.490 --> 00:23.860
For a rookie like me, 
that kind of table talk is a full-on feast!

00:23.860 --> 00:27.290
What areas did you travel through 
before we met you at the church?

00:27.290 --> 00:31.010
I came down from the north side of Ruvinheigen.

00:31.010 --> 00:36.130
That area will get dangerous once 
the grand northern expedition begins...

00:38.470 --> 00:42.690
Spice and Wolf

00:42.690 --> 00:43.810
Spice and Wolf

00:43.810 --> 00:49.150
Spice and Wolf

02:07.430 --> 02:11.530
Thanks for all the information! 
Contact me again anytime.

02:08.190 --> 02:12.190
<b>Episode 4
Romantic Merchant 
and Moonlit Farewell</b>

02:11.530 --> 02:13.250
Yes, see you next time.

02:11.530 --> 02:14.070
I'll be waiting for you, Mister!

02:14.780 --> 02:17.420
I've confirmed what Zheren looks like.

02:17.420 --> 02:20.530
I'll have our people investigate him.

02:20.530 --> 02:21.490
Thank you very much.

02:21.490 --> 02:25.040
I hope we find the source 
of the issue you spoke of.

02:25.420 --> 02:30.120
But to be honest, I'm surprised 
all of this has happened in only one day.

02:30.610 --> 02:32.460
We were dubious initially,

02:32.460 --> 02:35.210
but this doesn't seem to be 
a simple case of fraud.

02:35.480 --> 02:37.220
He's been approaching merchants claiming

02:37.220 --> 02:40.340
that the value of the silver coin will go up, 
making everyone buy and collect them.

02:40.340 --> 02:43.720
But, in truth, the value 
of the coin will go down.

02:44.020 --> 02:48.680
They plan to buy all the coins from the 
merchants who will be in a hurry to sell them

02:48.680 --> 02:51.350
and gain a profit from their loss.

02:51.350 --> 02:55.270
The profits of the mastermind will be enormous.

02:56.340 --> 02:57.980
The merchants who were fooled

02:57.980 --> 03:01.290
won't announce their losses,
since it may affect their reputation.

03:01.290 --> 03:03.370
The story about the silver coin 
will not go public

03:03.370 --> 03:06.210
and the mastermind will be able to collect

03:06.210 --> 03:09.410
a large amount of silver coins 
without anyone's knowledge.

03:09.410 --> 03:13.970
I'm also quite curious about 
what they will do with all that silver.

03:13.970 --> 03:17.110
I'll speak to the higher officials 
in the trading company about it.

03:17.110 --> 03:18.530
Thank you very much.

03:19.550 --> 03:23.800
It's all about experience. 
Just like the scent on those marten furs.

03:27.930 --> 03:29.850
Do you think they will make it?

03:32.230 --> 03:34.480
Even if your assumptions are correct,

03:34.480 --> 03:38.150
we will not gain any benefit if the Milone 
Trading Company does not move quickly enough.

03:38.450 --> 03:41.360
Well, I think it will be fine.

03:41.640 --> 03:44.500
The Milone Trading Company 
has thrived on foreign land.

03:44.500 --> 03:46.790
Their ability to seize opportunities 
should be top-notch.

03:50.200 --> 03:51.210
What's the matter?

03:51.640 --> 03:57.040
I was just remembering the past.

03:57.450 --> 03:58.550
Looking at me?

03:58.880 --> 04:04.170
Well, he would act like you 
and end up tumbling quite grandly.

04:05.010 --> 04:07.910
He was a fool, but always full of cheer.

04:08.690 --> 04:12.300
He was not surprised at all by my wolf form.

04:12.300 --> 04:15.520
He was truly a strange one, 
but he was a nice guy.

04:17.390 --> 04:19.140
He must have been from Pasloe village.

04:19.140 --> 04:21.570
The one who asked you 
to bring bountiful wheat harvests...

04:21.570 --> 04:26.120
That's right. He treated me 
like he treated everyone else.

04:26.120 --> 04:29.830
Yes, he was my first friend.

04:30.820 --> 04:35.490
He was truly a fool. I was often speechless.

04:49.230 --> 04:50.130
What's the matter?

04:50.130 --> 04:52.730
There was something I had to tell you.

04:52.730 --> 04:56.140
At least I think I did, 
but I cannot remember it.

04:56.140 --> 04:59.440
I am sure that it was something important...

04:59.440 --> 05:02.530
If it was really important, 
I'm sure you'll remember it eventually.

05:02.530 --> 05:04.580
You are right.

05:10.020 --> 05:11.580
Friend, huh?

05:26.340 --> 05:29.760
I am the branch manager, Richten Marlheit.

05:30.060 --> 05:33.810
We'll take on this deal.

05:33.810 --> 05:37.600
Does that mean you found out 
who was behind Zheren?

05:37.600 --> 05:41.940
Yes. Medio Trading is backing him.

05:41.940 --> 05:45.480
I remember that they are 
the leading crop dealer in Pazzio

05:45.480 --> 05:47.950
and that they have 
many shipping vessels as well...

05:47.950 --> 05:53.330
However, it is impossible for them 
to carry out your suspicions alone.

05:53.940 --> 05:57.330
I believe there is a noble behind them.

05:57.330 --> 05:59.830
While we have not yet identified who it is,

05:59.830 --> 06:05.050
it won't matter as long as 
we make our move first.

06:05.510 --> 06:09.420
Then, let's begin talks about our shares.

06:12.290 --> 06:14.490
This is the best day of my life.

06:14.490 --> 06:16.100
You look quite happy.

06:16.100 --> 06:18.130
At least 200,000 Trenni silver coins...

06:18.130 --> 06:21.620
No, if things go well, 
400,000 Trenni silver coins will move.

06:21.620 --> 06:25.580
If the trading company gets ten percent 
of the profit, I'll get fifty percent.

06:26.230 --> 06:28.030
That's 2,000 silver coins!

06:28.030 --> 06:32.370
With that much money, 
I could open up a store in town!

06:32.660 --> 06:35.930
Well, I am glad that things 
seem to be going well...

06:39.520 --> 06:41.900
I told you to rest in the inn 
if you had a hangover.

06:42.450 --> 06:46.460
I was worried that you would be 
taken advantage of.

06:46.460 --> 06:47.930
What do you mean?

06:47.930 --> 06:49.850
I meant exactly what I said.

06:51.890 --> 06:55.620
Hang in there. The inn is 
right around the corner.

06:59.100 --> 06:59.820
Yes.

07:18.710 --> 07:19.960
Are you drawing the plans for your store?

07:20.820 --> 07:22.440
When did you wake up?

07:22.440 --> 07:24.980
I slept well and no longer feel sick.

07:24.980 --> 07:26.740
You are quite skilled.

07:26.740 --> 07:28.090
Not really...

07:28.440 --> 07:31.760
Is this your store? 
What town do you wish to settle in?

07:31.760 --> 07:35.860
I haven't decided yet. 
This is my ideal store in my ideal town.

07:36.550 --> 07:41.310
Every traveling merchant dreams of owning 
their own store, and I'm no exception.

07:41.650 --> 07:46.650
But if my deal with the Milone Trading Company 
works out, my dream will become a reality.

07:48.490 --> 07:51.490
Is it that great to own a store?

07:51.760 --> 07:53.850
Traveling merchants go from town to town

07:53.850 --> 07:56.520
and never stay in one place,
in order to make money.

07:56.520 --> 07:59.490
That's why I spend most of 
the year living in my carriage.

07:59.970 --> 08:03.210
Because of that, 
it's difficult to make close friends.

08:03.210 --> 08:05.580
At best, I have acquaintances 
in the places where I do business.

08:06.340 --> 08:09.250
If I open a store, I will become 
a member of that town.

08:09.250 --> 08:12.970
I'll be able to forge close friendships 
and have an easier time finding a wife.

08:14.330 --> 08:16.960
That's right. I need to tell Yarei about it.

08:16.960 --> 08:18.920
I'm sure he'll be happy for me.

08:18.920 --> 08:21.060
I might be able to do 
business with him again...

08:21.950 --> 08:24.610
I will be a bit at a loss...

08:24.610 --> 08:25.560
Why is that?

08:25.560 --> 08:29.780
Once you open a store, 
you will not move from there.

08:29.780 --> 08:34.200
I will have to travel alone 
or find a new traveling partner.

08:34.200 --> 08:36.250
You are the Wise Wolf Holo.

08:36.250 --> 08:38.330
You have the money from the marten furs, too.

08:38.730 --> 08:40.450
You won't have any problems traveling alone.

08:43.100 --> 08:44.870
I am tired of being alone.

08:50.190 --> 08:54.420
Well, I don't mind traveling with you 
until you return home.

08:58.660 --> 09:02.560
Even if I have money, 
I won't be able to own a store yet.

09:03.340 --> 09:04.690
Truly?

09:05.740 --> 09:07.400
Why would I lie?

09:08.690 --> 09:10.350
So, you know...

09:11.490 --> 09:13.530
don't make that face.

09:15.630 --> 09:16.380
Okay.

09:44.200 --> 09:45.790
How unlike you.

09:46.820 --> 09:49.920
I always have the same dream.

09:49.920 --> 09:50.770
Dream?

09:51.100 --> 09:54.800
When I wake up, I am completely alone.

09:54.800 --> 09:57.040
Yue, Inty...

09:57.040 --> 10:00.370
Paro and Myuri, too. They are all gone.

10:00.720 --> 10:02.980
I can live for hundreds of years.

10:02.980 --> 10:06.140
That is why I decided to travel.

10:06.140 --> 10:12.500
I was sure that I would see them again, 
but they are all nowhere to be found.

10:14.380 --> 10:18.340
I do not wish to wake up 
and find myself alone anymore.

10:19.190 --> 10:21.280
I am tired of being alone.

10:21.280 --> 10:23.220
It is cold being alone.

10:23.220 --> 10:26.350
It is lonely to be alone.

10:31.230 --> 10:34.610
Traveling merchants 
are troubled by a similar dream.

10:38.690 --> 10:40.160
How embarrassing.

10:41.570 --> 10:45.120
Your face is sticky with your tears. 
Hold on a moment.

10:49.930 --> 10:51.540
But this...

10:51.540 --> 10:53.400
I draw them up and throw them away.

10:53.400 --> 10:55.960
And, the deal has yet to succeed.

10:56.300 --> 10:58.010
I shouldn't count 
my chickens before they hatch.

11:04.930 --> 11:08.290
I owe you another large favor.

11:08.980 --> 11:10.220
I am still sleepy.

11:10.220 --> 11:11.900
Are you not sleeping?

11:11.900 --> 11:13.530
I will soon.

11:13.530 --> 11:15.340
It'll be a waste of the candle fee.

11:15.340 --> 11:17.490
What a merchant-like way of thinking.

11:36.730 --> 11:37.460
What are you doing?!

11:37.460 --> 11:39.800
Do not be so uncouth.

11:46.900 --> 11:48.540
I cannot breathe.

11:51.170 --> 11:53.270
Have your eyes grown used to the dark?

11:54.450 --> 11:55.290
What do you...

11:55.290 --> 11:58.150
I remembered the important thing 
I needed to tell you.

11:58.590 --> 12:01.980
You are trying to intervene in a large scheme.

12:01.980 --> 12:03.960
I am sure the enemy is also wary.

12:03.960 --> 12:05.490
Three people by the door.

12:05.910 --> 12:08.360
They are surely not the respectable type.

12:08.360 --> 12:10.210
Could it be Medio Trading?

12:10.750 --> 12:13.090
Fortunately, there are 
no people outside the building.

12:13.090 --> 12:14.830
Are you prepared?

12:20.790 --> 12:25.430
Please take a good look 
at my body under the moonlight!

12:42.980 --> 12:45.240
We need to give up the carriage.

12:45.240 --> 12:47.940
They have nothing to gain
 from killing your horse.

12:48.490 --> 12:50.750
We can retrieve it after things have settled.

13:04.830 --> 13:05.860
Run!

13:06.310 --> 13:07.130
Yeah!

13:15.530 --> 13:16.940
Just in case.

13:16.940 --> 13:19.210
You should hold onto some grains.

13:24.270 --> 13:25.240
They're hot.

13:25.240 --> 13:27.610
Because I dwell in that wheat!

13:29.010 --> 13:31.220
They're running toward 
the Milone Trading Company!

13:31.220 --> 13:32.620
Don't let them escape!

13:45.580 --> 13:48.300
Holo, let's go shopping once this is over.

13:48.300 --> 13:50.050
What are you saying so suddenly?

13:50.050 --> 13:52.260
I'll buy you a comb, a hat, 
and other things for you!

13:52.260 --> 13:53.930
What are you up to?

13:53.930 --> 13:56.780
Nothing. It's just that you have 
such beautiful hair.

13:59.050 --> 14:02.290
I would rather have a comb for my tail.

14:02.290 --> 14:04.360
Got it! I'll buy it for you.

14:04.360 --> 14:05.690
That is a promise.

14:05.690 --> 14:06.740
Yes!

14:11.820 --> 14:14.050
All right, we've almost reached 
the Milone Trading Company!

14:20.130 --> 14:21.720
They'll definitely pass through here!

14:21.720 --> 14:22.600
Don't let them escape!

14:22.600 --> 14:23.880
Reinforcements should be here soon.

14:23.880 --> 14:25.690
We'll search each nook and cranny!

14:23.880 --> 14:26.080
Things are looking quite bad for us.

14:26.080 --> 14:27.520
Should we split up?

14:27.520 --> 14:30.890
A good idea, but I have a better one.

14:30.890 --> 14:32.090
For instance?

14:32.090 --> 14:35.330
I will go out to the main street 
and attract them.

14:35.330 --> 14:37.440
In the meantime, you run for the Milone...

14:37.440 --> 14:39.260
Hold on. I can't do that!

14:39.260 --> 14:39.940
Listen well.

14:39.940 --> 14:43.370
Even if we split up, 
they will catch you quickly.

14:43.370 --> 14:46.620
I am Wise Wolf Holo. 
They cannot catch me easily.

14:46.620 --> 14:51.490
However, who will negotiate with the Milone 
Trading Company if you get caught?

14:51.490 --> 14:54.820
You have already revealed your plan to them.

14:54.820 --> 14:56.950
In order not to be abandoned by them,

14:56.950 --> 15:00.940
you must threaten them by saying 
you might betray them otherwise.

15:00.940 --> 15:01.880
No!

15:01.880 --> 15:06.830
Medio Trading will take you to 
the Church if they see your ears and tail!

15:07.340 --> 15:09.470
I just won't get caught.

15:09.890 --> 15:14.500
And even if I were caught, I should be able 
to hide my ears and tail for a day or so.

15:14.500 --> 15:16.640
Just come save me in time.

15:16.640 --> 15:17.450
You!

15:17.450 --> 15:21.490
You wish to open a store 
with the money you earn.

15:21.490 --> 15:25.360
And I told you I owed you a big favor.

15:25.750 --> 15:28.900
Are you trying to make me an ungrateful wolf?

15:29.180 --> 15:31.820
Don't be stupid! 
You'll be killed if they catch you!

15:31.820 --> 15:33.270
There's no way it would match your debt!

15:36.620 --> 15:38.660
Loneliness is a disease that leads to death.

15:39.630 --> 15:41.040
It matches well enough.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.530
I believe in you.

15:48.010 --> 15:50.260
You will definitely come for me.

15:53.970 --> 15:54.880
Found them!

15:54.880 --> 15:55.840
Roinu street!

15:55.840 --> 15:56.820
She's alone?

15:56.820 --> 15:59.130
There should be two of them! Find them!

16:01.340 --> 16:02.460
There he is!

16:11.010 --> 16:12.170
This is Lawrence from this afternoon!

16:12.170 --> 16:14.080
Save us! We're being attacked!

16:14.080 --> 16:15.090
There he is!

16:21.210 --> 16:25.110
Wait! Hey, hand that man over to us!

16:25.830 --> 16:27.000
Bastards!

16:27.380 --> 16:30.500
This is the Great Marquis 
Milone's Milone Trading Company,

16:30.500 --> 16:36.390
authorized by 33rd Grand Duke 
Roundio of the Roundio Grand Duchy!

16:36.390 --> 16:39.050
That fence is owned by the Marquis

16:39.050 --> 16:41.820
and anyone on these premises 
is the Marquis' guest.

16:41.820 --> 16:46.770
And all guests of the Marquis are under 
the protection of the Grand Duke of Roundio!

16:47.250 --> 16:48.320
Listen well!

16:48.320 --> 16:50.650
Hitting this place 
with that stick is the same

16:50.650 --> 16:54.070
as hitting the pedestal of 
His Highness the Grand Duke!

17:00.410 --> 17:01.340
Fall back!

17:03.610 --> 17:05.750
What a big fuss in the middle of the night.

17:05.750 --> 17:07.890
What in the world happened?

17:07.890 --> 17:09.540
I apologize for my rudeness.

17:09.540 --> 17:11.990
More importantly, thank you for saving me.

17:12.340 --> 17:15.630
If you wanna give thanks, thank Marquis 
Milone, who is far away from here.

17:16.060 --> 17:18.510
More importantly, who were they?

17:22.730 --> 17:25.940
I'm sure they were people from Medio Trading.

17:25.940 --> 17:27.530
I believe so.

17:27.530 --> 17:30.940
I think they've discovered my deal with you.

17:30.940 --> 17:32.820
They were probably trying to stop us.

17:32.820 --> 17:34.900
Stop us?

17:34.900 --> 17:38.600
My companion may have been captured.

17:38.600 --> 17:41.030
Could you please use the power 
of your company to take her back?

17:41.030 --> 17:44.610
One of our men followed them after the uproar

17:44.610 --> 17:50.000
and saw a young girl 
being forcefully taken away.

17:50.000 --> 17:53.050
That is probably my companion, Holo.

17:53.650 --> 17:56.900
She acted as a decoy so I could come here...

17:56.900 --> 17:58.260
I see.

17:58.260 --> 18:02.390
But, for what reason do you think 
they captured Ms. Holo?

18:02.390 --> 18:03.460
Like I said before!

18:03.460 --> 18:07.690
They wanted to prevent us from working 
with you and blocking Medio Trading's way.

18:09.740 --> 18:12.480
Isn't that a little strange?

18:12.480 --> 18:13.730
What's strange?!

18:13.730 --> 18:15.250
Please calm down.

18:15.250 --> 18:18.210
Something is strange. Definitely strange.

18:18.210 --> 18:19.410
How so?!

18:19.410 --> 18:24.160
Think about it. We are already 
collecting the coins.

18:24.490 --> 18:30.050
Can they stop anything 
by taking the two of you hostage?

18:30.050 --> 18:30.540
Huh?

18:30.940 --> 18:33.930
We are already collecting Trenni silver coins,

18:33.930 --> 18:39.260
which means we already fully understand 
the deal happening behind the scenes.

18:39.710 --> 18:42.650
If you hadn't told us what kind of 
money-making scheme it was

18:42.650 --> 18:46.250
and only told us to collect 
Trenni silver coins,

18:46.250 --> 18:49.270
there would be some use 
in taking your companion hostage.

18:49.910 --> 18:54.340
However, our company would never 
act in a situation like that.

18:54.340 --> 18:55.280
That means...

18:55.280 --> 18:56.200
Yes.

18:56.200 --> 18:59.740
Since we already have 
all the information we need,

18:59.740 --> 19:03.280
it doesn't matter 
what happened to the two of you.

19:03.280 --> 19:06.500
We have already invested 
a lot of money in this deal.

19:06.500 --> 19:11.570
If we compare the enormous 
amount of profit at stake

19:11.570 --> 19:13.790
with your personal grudge against us...

19:15.750 --> 19:20.510
I really hate to say this, but I would 
choose the profits of our company.

19:20.510 --> 19:22.760
I can't believe this!

19:45.810 --> 19:48.990
That's the reason I cannot see 
the reason for their actions.

19:50.770 --> 19:52.170
Please wait!

19:53.330 --> 19:56.340
I see that your companion is very dear to you.

19:56.340 --> 20:00.470
But if your thinking grows dull because of it, 
you are putting the cart before the horse.

20:02.930 --> 20:04.090
My apologies.

20:04.490 --> 20:11.350
No, if my wife were in the same situation 
I would also not be able to maintain my calm.

20:11.930 --> 20:14.100
All things considered, it's still strange.

20:14.550 --> 20:20.010
Medio Trading would know 
that we would make this decision.

20:20.010 --> 20:23.100
Even so, they targeted you.

20:23.100 --> 20:28.740
That means you must have 
some kind of leverage against us.

20:28.740 --> 20:31.690
Does anything come to mind?

20:34.170 --> 20:38.000
The profit before us is enormous.

20:38.000 --> 20:40.450
Please let me know, no matter how trivial.

20:40.450 --> 20:41.210
Could it be?

20:41.210 --> 20:44.970
Mr. Lawrence, you have some idea, don't you!

20:50.060 --> 20:51.440
Excuse me.

20:51.440 --> 20:52.270
What is it?

20:52.270 --> 20:55.020
A letter was tossed into our grounds.

20:55.020 --> 20:57.500
I believe it is related to current events.

20:58.510 --> 21:01.480
"To the wolf and the forest the wolf lives in"?

21:03.890 --> 21:07.570
I'm sorry. May I read that first?

21:10.380 --> 21:11.580
Here.

21:20.040 --> 21:24.890
"We have the wolf. The door 
of the Church is always open.

21:25.270 --> 21:29.990
Close the doors with those 
in your house to keep the wolf out."

21:37.220 --> 21:39.500
My companion, Holo,

21:40.620 --> 21:44.030
is an incarnation of a wolf 
that brings bountiful harvests!

23:40.410 --> 23:41.660
You are...

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
Episode 5

23:45.020 --> 23:50.030
Wolf Incarnate and Obedient Lamb

23:45.540 --> 23:49.550
Next Episode: Wolf Incarnate and Obedient Lamb
